      "id": "25890158",
      "title": "Module Introduction",
      "sourceHash": "3932108feadba063dc44c13d7c311df17d32e2f8080a89042a1c8c96111653fb",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 3.19,
          "en": "In this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.19,
          "end": 5.89,
          "en": "you'll learn a lot about React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.89,
          "end": 8.72,
          "en": "You'll learn about all those core features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.72,
          "end": 11.58,
          "en": "that make up React and you are able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.58,
          "end": 13.46,
          "en": "to build your own React apps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.46,
          "end": 15.93,
          "en": "if you went through that course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.93,
          "end": 18.52,
          "en": "But in this entire course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.52,
          "end": 22.31,
          "en": "we used React with JavaScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.31,
          "end": 25.97,
          "en": "With the JavaScript programming language",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.97,
          "end": 29.52,
          "en": "because React is a JavaScript library",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.52,
          "end": 33.5,
          "en": "and most examples and demos and the official documentation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.5,
          "end": 38.5,
          "en": "which you find out there is about React with JavaScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.88,
          "end": 43.36,
          "en": "But you actually can also use React with TypeScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.36,
          "end": 46.85,
          "en": "And that's what this course section is about.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.85,
          "end": 49.05,
          "en": "Now for that, I'll first of all explain",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.05,
          "end": 54.05,
          "en": "what exactly TypeScript is and why we might want to use it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.39,
          "end": 55.28,
          "en": "Good news is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.28,
          "end": 58.37,
          "en": "that it's not a totally new programming language.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.37,
          "end": 61.7,
          "en": "Instead it builds up on JavaScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.7,
          "end": 65.96,
          "en": "Then I'll walk you through some TypeScript fundamentals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.96,
          "end": 67.71,
          "en": "some important basics,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.71,
          "end": 71.11,
          "en": "which you need to know about TypeScript in order to use it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.11,
          "end": 73.71000000000001,
          "en": "And then of course, most importantly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.71000000000001,
          "end": 78.53999999999999,
          "en": "in this section I will show you how you can use TypeScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.53999999999999,
          "end": 80.8,
          "en": "in combination with React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.8,
          "end": 84.953,
          "en": "how you can write your React code with TypeScript.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
